ist group is outside the house  explodes indicating that the pill that  was fed to man seek worked back in the  house taiji calls the director and  introduces her to ming ming his house is  also filled with all the animals he has  talked to by now they finally call a  limo for ming ming and send her to the  venue where the leaders are meeting  while seeing her off ali smells a weird  scent and follows it he is kidnapped by  dimitri's people again taiji and his  daughter see them taking him away but  cannot stop them in time taiji returns  home and asks the parrot to find ali the  parrot in turn tells all the birds in  the city and starts looking for the dog  meanwhile dimitri forcefully makes ali  and other military dogs eat the  explosive capsule since they will also  be in the venue dimitri wants to use  them to cause the explosion the program  finally begins and the world leaders  meet each other when it is ming ming's  time to perform dmitry starts the  countdown through his phone the dogs are  let out making everyone panic since the  doors are locked from outside the  audience doesn't get to run away with  only a few seconds left on the clock  taiji runs to crony and uses his special  pen the signal freezes all electronic  devices including dimitri's phone which  means the explosives are diffused  dimitri tries to run away but is chased  by ali they get to the rooftop and fight  each other in the process ali is  severely injured dimitri is about to  shoot the dog when taiju saves his life  but gets shot himself in the process in  the next scene taiji wakes up in a  hospital bed he finds out that ali is  also at a vet and is not doing well he  rushes to meet the dog and finds him  dead on the table he and sio yan cry  mourning his death however a while later  the vet says that ali is just sleeping  the ending scene shows us ali receiving  a medal for his bravery from the  director subscribe for more videos like  this turn on notifications and leave a  like to he